#: src/components/Documentation/index.tsx
#~ msgid "Alps DAO utilizes a fork of {compoundGovLink} and is the main governing body of the Alps ecosystem. The Alps DAO treasury receives 100% of ETH proceeds from daily Alp auctions. Each Alp is an irrevocable member of Alps DAO and entitled to one vote in all governance matters. Alp votes are non-transferable (if you sell your Alp the vote goes with it) but delegatable, which means you can assign your vote to someone else as long as you own your Alp."
#~ msgstr "Alps DAOは {compoundGovLink} のフォークを利用しており、Alpsエコシステムの主要な統治機関です。毎日起こるAlpオークションから得られるETHの収益の100％はAlps DAO トレジャリーにて受け取られています。各AlpはAlps DAOの変更不可能なメンバーであり、すべてのガバナンスの問題で1票の投票権を有します。Alpの票は譲渡できませんが (Alpの売却にはそれに応じて票も移ります)、委任することができます。"

#: src/components/Documentation/index.tsx
#~ msgid "Alps DAO utilizes {alpsDAOLink}’s fork of {compoundGovLink} and is the main governing body of the Alps ecosystem. The Alps DAO treasury receives 100% of ETH proceeds from Alp auctions. Each Alp is an irrevocable member of Alps DAO and entitled to one vote in all governance matters. Alp votes are non-transferable (if you sell your Alp the vote goes with it) but delegatable, which means you can assign your vote to someone else as long as you own your Alp."
#~ msgstr ""

